SUMMARY:[Curated Role Feeds] Notice of Public Meetings for the Acadia Nati
 onal Park Advisory Commission
DESCRIPTION:In accordance with the Federal Advisory Committee Act\, as ame
 nded\, the National Park Service (NPS) is hereby giving notice that the Ac
 adia National Park Advisory Commission (Commission) will meet as indicated
